pkg.description:
C3 application package this Type System element _belongs_ to; note that this maybe different from the package
where this type-system element was declared.

@see #package

unionRefType.description:
This declares that the values are constrained to those defined on the named union type. The binding of the union
type contains the restrictions.

```type
union type Stringish = string | [string]

type X {
  string: Stringish
}
```

@see Union
